  * fix the case where the buffer for past_state == present_state (#28753)
- Update bundled onnx from 1.21.0 to 1.22.0, following ONNX Runtime's
  cmake/deps.txt pin. All other dependencies, bundled and system, are
  unchanged.
- Apply ONNX Runtime's own cmake/patches/onnx/onnx.patch to the bundled
  onnx sources in %prep. It is normally applied through the onnx
  FetchContent PATCH_COMMAND, but setting FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_ONNX
  makes CMake skip the whole populate step, patch step included, so it
  had never been applied. Its functional hunk drops .Deprecate() from
  the GroupNormalization-18 schema.
- Explicitly build with onnxruntime_USE_TELEMETRY=OFF. 1.29.0 adds
  telemetry support for non-Windows platforms via Microsoft's 1DS SDK
  (cpp_client_telemetry, curl, mbedTLS); it is off by default upstream,
  and pinning it off keeps it that way.

